# Scan OUTPUTS, never inputs. This pattern named one package (`fleet`) and so let two other scans'
# reports — `report.agc.Fleet.json`, `report.fixture.Fleet.json` — be committed by accident in
# b5de79a. They were referenced by nothing and went stale at the next floor bump, where
# release-preflight flagged them as engine artifacts declaring the previous contract.
report.*.Fleet.*
